_refine_special_details           
;
The refinement of the present structure shows some B alerts as signalled 
by the checkcif online procedure. Those are: 
1)the ratio observed/unique reflections is too low (32%).
2)wR2 is high (30.14%).
3)some atoms have high Ueq.
Those features are not related with wrong atom assignment or with other errors 
in refinement or data collection. They are simply due to the fact that data were 
collected at high temperature (110 Celsius). This, of course, produces 
a systematic lowering of diffracted intensities and a very high thermal motion 
of atoms.
;
_refine_ls_structure_factor_coef  Fsqd
_refine_ls_matrix_type            full
_refine_ls_weighting_scheme       calc
